    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "一个看似专业的名字「InstructGPT」，背后藏着怎样一个直观问题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "大型预训练模型能够流畅续写文本，却不能稳定理解用户意图。InstructGPT 延续早期人类偏好研究，直接尝试在预训练之后对齐模型行为。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-instructgpt-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "流程先使用人类示范进行监督微调，再从排序后的回答中学习奖励模型，最后用 PPO 优化策略。把这些阶段分开，使定性的偏好判断转化为可训练信号。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-instructgpt-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 InstructGPT 视为现代 RLHF 后训练的操作模板。它的重要性不只在参数规模，而在于证明更小的对齐模型也可能比大得多的未调优基线更受用户偏好。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-instructgpt-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "「InstructGPT」留下的关键，不只是一项成果，而是一种后来可以继续检验、改造和扩展的方法。",
